    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">libde265 Dependencies</bridgehead>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Optional</bridgehead>
    <para role="optional">
      <xref linkend="sdl2"/> (for YUV overlay output support of
<command>dec265</command>), both <ulink
url="https://&lfs-domainname;/blfs/view/12.2/x/qt5-components.html">Qt
